00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:57.480
suppliers and use upward revisions and guidance as independent confirmation that underlying demand

00:03:57.480 --> 00:04:03.180
is still accelerating rather than peaking. In an environment where the S&amp;P 500 is making fresh

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:08.400
