00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:14.200
becomes an excellent filter to separate genuine momentum from retail hype. Let me give you some

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:19.740
context. We saw this playbook work beautifully during the cloud adoption wave from 2013 through

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:24.580
2017. When the big hyperscalers started raising their capital expenditure guidance,

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:29.420
the companies that made the specialized networking gear, power systems, and cooling components

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:35.160
began raising their own forecast shortly afterward. Investors who systematically followed those

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:42.420
supplier revisions captured meaningful outperformance versus the broad indices, often 400-700 basis points

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:48.060
annualized during the early-to-mid stages of that multi-year cycle. The same logic applies today

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:54.620
with AI. When TSMC raises its full-year outlook because AI-related wafer demand keeps surprising to

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:59.940
that's not just noise, though it's a downstream signal that the entire ecosystem is still in

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:04.840
growth mode. Implementation on everyday Canadian platforms is refreshingly accessible,

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:10.420
whether you use Questrade, Interactive Brokers, or even WealthSimple Premium, you can screen for

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:14.960
suppliers that have recently beaten earnings and raised guidance. Pay particular attention

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:20.400
to commentary around AI buildout pace, order visibility, and capacity utilization.

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:25.440
Once you've identified two or three names that check those boxes, the rule is simple.

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:29.800
Allocate only five to ten percent of your thematic sleeve to any single name,

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:35.800
and use the 20-day moving average as a trailing stop. This keeps the position-sized responsibly

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:39.760
and gives the trade room to breathe while protecting you from sudden trend reversals.

